	wider; .acts [hidden] stays hidden (.btn sets display).
	* tests/a11y-check.mjs: rules and four planted faults for the above.
	* tests/browser/app.browser.mjs: checks for the above (a first visit
	shows no Draw or Go; the prompt holds the story; settings closed).

